#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:4
msgid "SkillGen for Automated Demonstration Generation"
msgstr "使用 SkillGen 自动生成示范"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:6
msgid ""
"SkillGen is an advanced demonstration generation system that enhances Isaac "
"Lab Mimic by integrating motion planning. It generates high-quality, "
"adaptive, collision-free robot demonstrations by combining human-provided "
"subtask segments with automated motion planning."
msgstr ""
"SkillGen 通过集成运动规划，扩展了 Isaac Lab Mimic "
"的示范生成能力。它结合人工提供的子任务片段与自动运动规划，生成高质量、可适应不同场景且无碰撞的机器人示范。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:9
msgid "What is SkillGen?"
msgstr "什么是 SkillGen？"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:11
msgid ""
"SkillGen addresses key limitations in traditional demonstration generation:"
msgstr "SkillGen 解决了传统示范生成的几项局限："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Motion Quality**: Uses cuRobo's GPU-accelerated motion planner to generate"
" smooth, collision-free trajectories"
msgstr "**运动质量** ：使用 cuRobo 的 GPU 加速运动规划器生成平滑、无碰撞的轨迹。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Validity**: Generates kinematically feasible plans between skill segments"
msgstr "**有效性** ：在技能片段之间生成运动学可行的运动规划。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Diversity**: Generates varied demonstrations through configurable sampling"
" and planning parameters"
msgstr "**多样性** ：通过可配置的采样与规划参数生成多样化示范。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Adaptability**: Generates demonstrations that can be adapted to new object"
" placements and scene configurations during data generation"
msgstr "**适应性** ：在数据生成过程中，使示范适应新的物体位置和场景配置。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:18
msgid ""
"The system works by taking manually annotated human demonstrations, "
"extracting localized subtask skills (see `Subtasks in SkillGen`_), and using"
" cuRobo to plan feasible motions between these skill segments while "
"respecting robot kinematics and collision constraints."
msgstr ""
"系统从人工标注的人类示范中提取局部子任务技能（见 `SkillGen 中的子任务 <Subtasks in SkillGen_>`_ ），再使用 "
"cuRobo 在技能片段之间规划可行运动，同时满足机器人运动学和碰撞约束。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:21
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置要求"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:23
msgid "Before using SkillGen, you must understand:"
msgstr "使用 SkillGen 前，需要了解："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Teleoperation**: How to control robots and record demonstrations using "
"keyboard, SpaceMouse, or hand tracking"
msgstr "**遥操作** ：如何通过键盘、SpaceMouse 或手部跟踪控制机器人并录制示范。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Isaac Lab Mimic**: The complete workflow including data collection, "
"annotation, generation, and policy training"
msgstr "**Isaac Lab Mimic** ：包括数据采集、标注、生成和策略训练在内的完整工作流。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:30
msgid ""
"Review the :ref:`teleoperation-imitation-learning` documentation thoroughly "
"before proceeding with SkillGen."
msgstr "使用 SkillGen 前，请先仔细阅读 :ref:`teleoperation-imitation-learning` 文档。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:35
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:37
msgid ""
"SkillGen requires Isaac Lab, Isaac Sim, and cuRobo. Follow these steps in "
"your Isaac Lab environment (uv or conda), matching the installation method "
"used in Step 1."
msgstr ""
"SkillGen 需要 Isaac Lab、Isaac Sim 和 cuRobo。请在 Isaac Lab 环境（uv 或 "
"conda）中按以下步骤操作，安装方式应与步骤 1 一致。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:40
msgid "Step 1: Install and verify Isaac Sim and Isaac Lab"
msgstr "步骤 1：安装并验证 Isaac Sim 和 Isaac Lab"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:42
msgid ""
"Follow :ref:`installation-method-python-env` in the official Isaac Sim and "
"Isaac Lab installation guide."
msgstr ""
"按官方 Isaac Sim 与 Isaac Lab 安装指南中的 :ref:`installation-method-python-env` 操作。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:45
msgid "Step 2: Install cuRobo"
msgstr "步骤 2：安装 cuRobo"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:47
msgid ""
"cuRobo provides the motion planning capabilities for SkillGen. Compile it "
"with the CUDA 13.0 toolkit (``nvcc``) to match Isaac Lab's PyTorch build. "
"The toolkit is needed at build time; PyTorch and Isaac Sim supply their "
"runtime libraries. Select the compiler through ``CUDA_HOME`` and ``PATH`` "
"without adding toolkit libraries to ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``."
msgstr ""
"cuRobo 为 SkillGen 提供运动规划能力。请使用 CUDA 13.0 工具包（ ``nvcc`` ）编译，与 Isaac Lab 的 "
"PyTorch 构建版本匹配。工具包只在构建时需要；运行时库由 PyTorch 和 Isaac Sim 提供。通过 ``CUDA_HOME`` 和 "
"``PATH`` 选择编译器，不要将工具包的库加入 ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH`` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:52
msgid "Install the host compiler and Git on Ubuntu x86_64:"
msgstr "在 Ubuntu x86_64 上安装主机编译器和 Git："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:0
msgid "uv"
msgstr "uv"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:63
msgid ""
"Install CUDA 13.0 from the NVIDIA repository (the toolkit package leaves the"
" driver unchanged; replace ``ubuntu2404`` with ``ubuntu2204`` on Ubuntu "
"22.04):"
msgstr ""
"从 NVIDIA 软件源安装 CUDA 13.0（工具包不会改动驱动；在 Ubuntu 22.04 上，请将 ``ubuntu2404`` 替换为 "
"``ubuntu2204`` ）："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:73
msgid ""
"Then build and install cuRobo into the Isaac Lab environment. Run this from "
"the root of your Isaac Lab repository. The ``uv sync`` step creates the "
"project's virtual environment (``.venv``) if it does not already exist and "
"makes PyTorch available for the build; the cuRobo repository is cloned first"
" because ``uv pip`` does not support editable installs from Git URLs:"
msgstr ""
"然后构建 cuRobo，并安装到 Isaac Lab 环境。在 Isaac Lab 仓库根目录运行以下命令。 ``uv sync`` 会在项目虚拟环境（"
" ``.venv`` ）不存在时创建它，并为构建提供 PyTorch。由于 ``uv pip`` 不支持从 Git URL 进行可编辑安装，需要先克隆 "
"cuRobo 仓库："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:0
msgid "conda"
msgstr "conda"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:105
msgid ""
"The commit hash ``ebb71702f3f70e767f40fd8e050674af0288abe8`` is tested with "
"Isaac Lab - using other versions may cause compatibility issues. This commit"
" has the support for quad face mesh triangulation, required for cuRobo to "
"parse usds as collision objects."
msgstr ""
"提交 ``ebb71702f3f70e767f40fd8e050674af0288abe8`` 已通过 Isaac Lab "
"测试，使用其他版本可能产生兼容性问题。此提交支持将四边形网格面三角化，cuRobo 需要这项功能来将 USD 解析为碰撞对象。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:107
msgid ""
"Use a host compiler supported by CUDA 13.0, as specified by NVIDIA's `host "
"compiler support policy <https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/archive/13.0.0/cuda-"
"installation-guide-linux/index.html#host-compiler-support-policy>`__ and "
"`C++ dialect requirements <https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/archive/13.0.0/cuda-"
"installation-guide-linux/index.html#supported-c-dialects>`__. The system GCC"
" on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 is compatible. The conda commands explicitly "
"select the system compiler."
msgstr ""
"请使用 CUDA 13.0 支持的主机编译器，要求见 NVIDIA 的 `主机编译器支持策略 "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/archive/13.0.0/cuda-installation-guide-"
"linux/index.html#host-compiler-support-policy>`__ 及 `C++ 标准要求 "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/archive/13.0.0/cuda-installation-guide-"
"linux/index.html#supported-c-dialects>`__ 。Ubuntu 22.04 和 24.04 的系统 GCC "
"均兼容。conda 命令会显式选择系统编译器。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:113
msgid ""
"cuRobo is installed from source and is editable installed. This means that "
"the cuRobo source code will be cloned in the current directory under "
"``src/nvidia-curobo``. Users can choose their working directory to install "
"cuRobo."
msgstr ""
"cuRobo 以可编辑方式从源码安装，源码克隆到当前目录下的 ``src/nvidia-curobo`` 。可自行选择用于安装 cuRobo "
"的工作目录。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:115
msgid ""
"In the uv flow, cuRobo and Rerun (Step 3) are not part of the project's "
"lockfile, so running ``uv sync`` after installing them removes them from the"
" environment again. If that happens, re-run the ``uv pip install`` commands "
"from Step 2 and Step 3 to reinstall them. ``uv run`` does not remove these "
"packages and can be used normally."
msgstr ""
"在 uv 流程中，cuRobo 和 Rerun（步骤 3）不在项目锁定文件中，安装它们后运行 ``uv sync`` "
"会再次将它们移出环境。如果发生这种情况，重新运行步骤 2、3 的 ``uv pip install`` 命令即可。 ``uv run`` "
"不会移除这些包，可以正常使用。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:117
msgid ""
"``TORCH_CUDA_ARCH_LIST`` in the above command should match your GPU's CUDA "
"compute capability (e.g., ``8.0`` for A100, ``8.6`` for many RTX 30‑series, "
"``8.9`` for RTX 4090); the ``+PTX`` suffix embeds PTX for forward "
"compatibility so newer GPUs can JIT‑compile when native SASS isn’t included."
msgstr ""
"上述命令中的 ``TORCH_CUDA_ARCH_LIST`` 应与您的 GPU 的 CUDA 计算能力匹配（例如，A100 为 ``8.0`` ，许多"
" RTX 30 系列为 ``8.6`` ，RTX 4090 为 ``8.9`` ）； ``+PTX`` 后缀嵌入 PTX "
"以实现前向兼容性，以便在不包含原生 SASS 时，较新的 GPU 可以进行 JIT 编译。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:121
msgid ""
"**cuRobo installation may fail if Isaac Sim environment scripts are "
"sourced**"
msgstr "**如果引入了 Isaac Sim 环境脚本，cuRobo 安装可能会失败**"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:123
msgid ""
"Sourcing Omniverse Kit/Isaac Sim environment scripts (for example, "
"``setup_conda_env.sh``) exports ``PYTHONHOME`` and ``PYTHONPATH`` to the Kit"
" runtime and its pre-bundled Python packages. During cuRobo installation "
"this can cause ``conda`` to import Omniverse's bundled libraries (e.g., "
"``requests``/``urllib3``) before initialization, resulting in a crash (often"
" seen as a ``TypeError`` referencing ``omni.kit.pip_archive``)."
msgstr ""
"引入 Omniverse Kit/Isaac Sim 环境脚本（例如 ``setup_conda_env.sh`` ）会将 ``PYTHONHOME``"
" 和 ``PYTHONPATH`` 导出到 Kit 运行时及其预捆绑的 Python 包。在 cuRobo 安装期间，这可能导致 ``conda`` "
"在初始化之前导入 Omniverse 的捆绑库（例如 ``requests``/``urllib3`` ），从而导致崩溃（通常表现为引用 "
"``omni.kit.pip_archive`` 的 ``TypeError`` ）。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:125
msgid "Do one of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下操作之一:"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:127
msgid ""
"Install cuRobo from a clean shell that has not sourced any Omniverse/Isaac "
"Sim scripts."
msgstr "从未引入任何 Omniverse/Isaac Sim 脚本的干净 shell 中安装 cuRobo。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:128
msgid ""
"Temporarily reset or ignore inherited Python environment variables (notably "
"``PYTHONPATH`` and ``PYTHONHOME``) before invoking Conda, so Kit's Python "
"does not shadow your Conda environment."
msgstr ""
"在调用 Conda 之前临时重置或忽略继承的 Python 环境变量（特别是 ``PYTHONPATH`` 和 ``PYTHONHOME`` ），以便 "
"Kit 的 Python 不会遮蔽您的 Conda 环境。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:129
msgid ""
"Use Conda mechanisms that do not rely on shell activation and avoid "
"inheriting the current shell's Python variables."
msgstr "使用不依赖于 shell 激活的 Conda 机制，并避免继承当前 shell 的 Python 变量。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:131
msgid ""
"After installation completes, you may source Isaac Lab/Isaac Sim scripts "
"again for normal use."
msgstr "安装完成后，您可以再次引入 Isaac Lab/Isaac Sim 脚本以供正常使用。"

