msgstr "Rerun 是可选的，但强烈建议用于调试和验证开发过程中计划的轨迹"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:159
msgid ""
"Enable trajectory visualization by setting ``visualize_plan = True`` in the "
