msgstr "通过在 cuRobo 规划器配置中设置 ``visualize_plan = True`` 来启用轨迹可视化"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:160
msgid ""
"When enabled, cuRobo planner interface will stream planned end-effector "
"trajectories, waypoints, and collision data to Rerun for interactive "
"inspection"
msgstr "启用后，cuRobo 规划器接口将向 Rerun 进行计划的末端执行器轨迹、路径点以及碰撞数据的实时传输，以进行交互式检查"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:161
msgid ""
"Visualization helps identify planning issues, collision problems, and "
"trajectory smoothness before full dataset generation"
msgstr "可视化有助于在生成完整数据集之前识别规划问题、碰撞问题和轨迹平滑性"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:162
msgid ""
"Can also run headless to reduce Isaac Sim visualization overhead while still"
" visualizing and debugging end-effector trajectories with Rerun"
msgstr "也可以无界面运行，以降低 Isaac Sim 可视化开销，同时仍通过 Rerun 查看和调试末端执行器轨迹。"

