#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:297
msgid "Understanding Dataset Annotation"
msgstr "理解数据集标注"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:299
msgid ""
"SkillGen requires datasets with annotated subtask start and termination "
"boundaries. Auto-annotation is not supported."
msgstr "SkillGen 需要具有标注子任务开始和结束边界的数据集。不支持自动注释。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:302
msgid "Subtasks in SkillGen"
msgstr "SkillGen 中的子任务"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:304
msgid ""
"**Technical definition:** A subtask is a contiguous demo segment that "
"achieves a manipulation objective, defined via ``SubTaskConfig``:"
msgstr "**技术定义:** 子任务是通过 ``SubTaskConfig`` 定义的实现操作目标的连续演示段: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:306
msgid ""
"``object_ref``: the object (or ``None``) used as the spatial reference for "
"this subtask"
msgstr "``object_ref``: 用作此子任务的空间参考的对象（或 ``None`` ）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:307
msgid ""
"``subtask_term_signal``: the binary termination signal name (transitions 0 "
"to 1 when the subtask completes)"
msgstr "``subtask_term_signal``: 二进制终止信号名称（在子任务完成时从 0 变为 1）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:308
msgid ""
"``subtask_start_signal``: the binary start signal name (transitions 0 to 1 "
"when the subtask begins; required for SkillGen)"
msgstr "``subtask_start_signal``: 二进制开始信号名称（在子任务开始时从 0 变为 1; SkillGen 需要）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:310
msgid "The subtask localization process performs:"
msgstr "子任务本地化过程执行: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:312
msgid ""
"detection of signal transition points (0 to 1) to identify subtask "
"boundaries ``[t_start, t_end]``;"
msgstr "检测信号转换点（从 0 到 1）以识别子任务边界 ``[t_start, t_end]``;"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:313
msgid "extraction of the subtask segment between boundaries;"
msgstr "在边界之间提取子任务段;"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:314
msgid ""
"computation of end-effector trajectories and key poses in an object- or "
"task-relative frame (using ``object_ref`` if provided);"
msgstr "在对象或任务相关帧中计算末端执行器轨迹和关键姿势（使用 ``object_ref`` 如果提供）;"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:316
msgid ""
"This converts absolute, scene-specific motions into object-relative skill "
"segments that can be adapted to new object placements and scene "
"configurations during data generation."
msgstr "这将绝对的、特定于场景的运动转换为对象相对技能段，可以在数据生成过程中适应新的对象放置和场景配置。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:319
msgid "Manual Annotation Workflow"
msgstr "手动注释工作流程"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:320
msgid ""
"Contrary to the Isaac Lab Mimic workflow, SkillGen requires manual "
"annotation of subtask start and termination boundaries. For example, for "
"grasping a cube, the start signal is right before the gripper closes and the"
" termination signal is right after the object is grasped. You can adjust the"
" start and termination signals to fit your subtask definition."
msgstr ""
"与 Isaac Lab Mimic 工作流程相反，SkillGen "
"需要手动注释子任务开始和结束边界。例如，为了抓取一个立方体，开始信号是在夹具关闭之前，终止信号是在物体被抓取之后。您可以调整开始和终止信号以符合您的子任务定义。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:324
msgid "**Manual Annotation Controls:**"
msgstr "**手动注释控件:**"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:326
msgid "Press ``N`` to start/continue playback"
msgstr "按 ``N`` 开始/继续播放"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:327
msgid "Press ``B`` to pause"
msgstr "按 ``B`` 暂停"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:328
msgid "Press ``S`` to mark subtask boundary"
msgstr "按 ``S`` 标记子任务边界"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:329
msgid "Press ``Q`` to skip current demonstration"
msgstr "按 ``Q`` 跳过当前演示"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:331
msgid ""
"When annotating the start and end signals for a skill segment (e.g., grasp, "
"stack, etc.), pause the playback using ``B`` a few steps before the skill, "
"annotate the start signal using ``S``, and then resume playback using ``N``."
" After the skill is completed, pause again a few steps later to annotate the"
" end signal using ``S``."
msgstr ""
"在为技能段（例如抓取、堆叠等）标注开始和结束信号时，使用 ``B`` 在技能前几步暂停播放，使用 ``S`` 注释开始信号，然后使用 ``N`` "
"恢复播放。技能完成后，再次在技能后几步暂停并使用 ``S`` 注释结束信号。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:334
msgid "Data Generation with SkillGen"
msgstr "使用 SkillGen 进行数据生成"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:336
msgid ""
"SkillGen transforms annotated demonstrations into diverse, high-quality "
"datasets using motion planning."
msgstr "SkillGen 使用运动规划将标注的演示转换为多样化、高质量的数据集。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:339
msgid "How SkillGen Works"
msgstr "SkillGen 的工作原理"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:341
msgid ""
"The SkillGen pipeline uses your annotated dataset and the environment's "
"Mimic API to synthesize new demonstrations:"
msgstr "SkillGen 管道使用您的标注数据集和环境的 Mimic API 合成新的演示: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:343
msgid ""
"**Subtask boundary use**: Reads per-subtask start and termination indices "
"from the annotated dataset"
msgstr "**子任务边界使用**: 从标注数据集中读取每个子任务的开始和终止索引"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:344
msgid ""
"**Goal sampling**: Samples target poses per subtask according to task "
"constraints and datagen config"
msgstr "**目标采样**: 根据任务约束和数据生成配置对每个子任务采样目标姿势"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:345
msgid ""
"**Trajectory planning**: Plans collision-free motions between subtask "
"segments using cuRobo (when ``--use_skillgen``)"
msgstr "**轨迹规划**: 使用 cuRobo 在子任务段之间规划无碰撞运动（当 ``--use_skillgen`` 时）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:346
msgid ""
"**Trajectory stitching**: Stitches skill segments and planned trajectories "
"into complete demonstrations."
msgstr "**轨迹拼接**: 将技能段和规划的轨迹拼接成完整的演示。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:347
msgid ""
"**Success evaluation**: Validates task success terms; only successful trials"
" are written to the output dataset"
msgstr "**成功评估**: 验证任务成功条件; 只有成功的试验才会被写入输出数据集"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:350
msgid "Usage Parameters"
msgstr "使用参数"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:352
msgid "Key parameters for SkillGen data generation:"
msgstr "SkillGen 数据生成的关键参数: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:354
msgid "``--use_skillgen``: Enables SkillGen planner (required)"
msgstr "``--use_skillgen``: 启用 SkillGen 规划器（必需）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:355
msgid "``--generation_num_trials``: Number of demonstrations to generate"
msgstr "``--generation_num_trials``: 要生成的演示次数"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:356
msgid "``--num_envs``: Parallel environments (tune based on GPU memory)"
msgstr "``--num_envs``: 并行环境（根据 GPU 内存调整）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:357
msgid ""
"``--device``: Computation device (cpu/cuda). Use cpu for stable physics"
msgstr "``--device``: 计算设备（cpu/cuda）。使用 cpu 可获得稳定的物理效果"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:358
msgid ""
"Visualization: Omit ``--visualizer`` / ``--viz`` for headless generation; "
"use ``--viz none`` only when a config or command would otherwise launch "
"visualizers"
msgstr ""
"可视化：省略 ``--visualizer`` / ``--viz`` 可无界面生成；只有配置或命令原本会启动可视化器时，才需使用 ``--viz "
"none`` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:363
msgid "Task 1: Basic Cube Stacking"
msgstr "任务 1: 基本立方体堆叠"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:365
msgid ""
"Generate demonstrations for the standard Isaac Lab Mimic cube stacking task."
" In this task, the Franka robot must:"
msgstr "为标准 Isaac Lab Mimic 立方体堆叠任务生成演示。在这个任务中，Franka 机器人必须: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:367
msgid "Pick up the red cube and place it on the blue cube"
msgstr "拿起红色立方体并将其放在蓝色立方体上"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:368
msgid "Pick up the green cube and place it on the red cube"
msgstr "拿起绿色立方体并将其放在红色立方体上"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:369
msgid "Final stack order: blue (bottom), red (middle), green (top)."
msgstr "最终堆叠顺序: 蓝色（底部）、红色（中部）、绿色（顶部）。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:371
msgid "Cube stacking task generated with SkillGen"
msgstr "使用 SkillGen 生成的立方体堆叠任务"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:377
msgid "Cube stacking dataset example."
msgstr "立方体堆叠数据集示例。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:380
#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:467
msgid "Small-Scale Generation"
msgstr "小规模生成"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:382
msgid "Start with a small dataset to verify everything works:"
msgstr "从一个小数据集开始验证一切是否正常: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:413
#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:500
msgid "Full-Scale Generation"
msgstr "大规模生成"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:415
msgid ""
"Once satisfied with small-scale results, generate a full training dataset:"
msgstr "一旦对小规模结果满意，生成一个完整的训练数据集: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:447
msgid ""
"Run headless for faster generation. Rerun visualization can be enabled by "
"setting ``visualize_plan = True`` in the cuRobo planner configuration while "
"keeping Isaac Sim visualizers disabled."
msgstr ""
"无界面运行可加快生成速度。保持 Isaac Sim 可视化器关闭，同时在 cuRobo 规划器配置中设置 ``visualize_plan = "
"True`` ，仍可启用 Rerun 可视化。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:448
msgid ""
"Adjust ``--num_envs`` based on your GPU memory (start with 1, increase "
"gradually). The performance gain is not very significant when num_envs is "
"greater than 1. A value of 5 seems to be a sweet spot for most GPUs to "
"balance performance and memory usage between cuRobo instances and simulation"
" environments."
msgstr ""
"根据您的 GPU 内存调整 ``--num_envs`` （从 1 开始，逐渐增加）。当 num_envs 大于 1 时，性能提升并不十分明显。5 "
"是大多数 GPU 之间性能和内存使用之间平衡的最佳值。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:449
msgid ""
"Generation time: ~90 to 120 minutes for one environment with visualizers "
"disabled for 1000 demonstrations on a RTX 6000 Ada GPU. Time depends on the "
"GPU, the number of environments, and the success rate of the demonstrations "
"(which depends on quality of the annotated dataset)."
msgstr ""
"生成时间：在 RTX 6000 Ada GPU 上，单环境关闭可视化器生成 1000 条示范约需 90–120 分钟。耗时取决于 "
"GPU、环境数量及示范成功率，而成功率又取决于已标注数据集的质量。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:450
msgid ""
"cuRobo planner interface and configurations are described in :ref:`cuRobo-"
"interface-features`."
msgstr "cuRobo 规划接口和配置在 :ref:`cuRobo-interface-features` 中描述。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:455
msgid "Task 2: Adaptive Cube Stacking in a Bin"
msgstr "任务 2: 垃圾箱中的自适应立方体堆叠"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:456
msgid ""
"SkillGen can also be used to generate datasets for adaptive tasks. In this "
"example, we generate a dataset for adaptive cube stacking in a narrow bin. "
"The bin is placed at a fixed position and orientation in the workspace and a"
" blue cube is placed at the center of the bin. The robot must generate "
"successful demonstrations for stacking the red and green cubes on the blue "
"cube without colliding with the bin."
msgstr ""
"SkillGen "
"也可用于生成自适应任务的数据集。在这个例子中，我们为在狭窄垃圾箱中的自适应立方体堆叠生成数据集。垃圾箱放置在工作区的固定位置和方向，并且一个蓝色立方体放置在垃圾箱的中心。机器人必须成功生成用于将红色和绿色立方体堆叠在蓝色立方体上的演示，而不与垃圾箱发生碰撞。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:458
msgid "Adaptive bin cube stacking task generated with SkillGen"
msgstr "使用 SkillGen 生成自适应垃圾箱立方体堆叠任务"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:464
msgid "Adaptive bin stacking data generation example."
msgstr "自适应垃圾箱堆叠数据生成示例。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:469
msgid "Test the adaptive stacking setup:"
msgstr "测试自适应堆叠设置: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:502
msgid "Generate the complete adaptive stacking dataset:"
msgstr "生成完整的自适应堆叠数据集: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:534
msgid ""
"Adaptive tasks typically have lower success rates and higher data generation"
" time due to increased complexity. The time taken to generate the dataset is"
" also longer due to lower success rates than vanilla cube stacking and "
"difficult planning problems."
msgstr "由于复杂性增加，自适应任务通常具有较低的成功率和较长的数据生成时间。由于成功率较低以及计划问题较困难，生成数据集所用的时间也较长。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:538
msgid ""
"If the pre-annotated dataset is used and the data generation command is run "
"headless, the generation time is typically around ~220 minutes for 1000 "
"demonstrations for a single environment on a RTX 6000 Ada GPU."
msgstr ""
"如果使用预先标注的数据集，并以无界面模式运行数据生成命令，在 RTX 6000 Ada GPU 上，单环境生成 1000 条示范通常约需 220 分钟。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:542
msgid "**VRAM usage and GPU recommendations**"
msgstr "**VRAM 使用情况和 GPU 建议**"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:544
msgid "Figures measured over 10 generated demonstrations on an RTX 6000 Ada."
msgstr "在 RTX 6000 Ada 上生成 10 个演示测得的数据。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:545
msgid ""
"Vanilla Cube Stacking: 1 env ~9.3–9.6 GB steady; 5 envs ~21.8–22.2 GB steady"
" (briefly higher during initialization)."
msgstr "基础立方体堆叠: 1 个环境约 9.3–9.6 GB 稳定；5 个环境约 21.8–22.2 GB 稳定（初始化期间短暂较高）。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:546
msgid ""
"Adaptive Bin Cube Stacking: 1 env ~9.3–9.6 GB steady; 5 envs ~22.0–22.3 GB "
"steady (briefly higher during initialization)."
msgstr "自适应箱立方体堆叠: 1 个环境约 9.3–9.6 GB 稳定；5 个环境约 22.0–22.3 GB 稳定（初始化期间短暂较高）。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:547
msgid ""
"Minimum recommended GPU: ≥24 GB VRAM for ``--num_envs`` 1–2; ≥48 GB VRAM for"
" ``--num_envs`` up to ~5."
msgstr ""
"最低推荐 GPU: ``--num_envs`` 1–2 时 ≥24 GB VRAM； ``--num_envs`` 最多约 5 时 ≥48 GB "
"VRAM。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:548
msgid ""
"To reduce VRAM: prefer headless runs and keep ``--num_envs`` modest. Numbers"
" can vary with scene assets and number of demonstrations."
msgstr "减少显存占用：优先无界面运行，并适度控制 ``--num_envs`` 。具体占用会随场景资产和示范数量变化。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:551
msgid "Learning Policies from SkillGen Data"
msgstr "从 SkillGen 数据中学习策略"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:553
msgid ""
"Similar to the Isaac Lab Mimic workflow, you can train imitation learning "
"policies using the generated SkillGen datasets with Robomimic."
msgstr ""
"类似于 Isaac Lab Mimic 工作流程，您可以使用生成的 SkillGen 数据集来训练模仿学习策略，也可以使用 Robomimic。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:556
msgid "Basic Cube Stacking Policy"
msgstr "基础立方体堆叠策略"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:558
msgid "Train a state-based policy for the basic cube stacking task:"
msgstr "为基本立方体叠放任务训练基于状态的策略: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:581
msgid "Adaptive Bin Cube Stacking Policy"
msgstr "自适应箱立方体堆叠策略"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:583
msgid "Train a policy for the more complex adaptive bin stacking:"
msgstr "为更复杂的自适应垃圾箱堆叠任务训练策略: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:607
msgid ""
"The training script will save the model checkpoints in the model directory "
"under ``IsaacLab/logs/robomimic``."
msgstr "训练脚本将模型检查点保存到 ``IsaacLab/logs/robomimic`` 下的模型目录。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:610
msgid "Evaluating Trained Policies"
msgstr "评估训练好的策略"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:612
msgid "Test your trained policies:"
msgstr "测试您训练好的策略: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:668
msgid ""
"**Expected Success Rates and Recommendations for Cube Stacking and Bin Cube "
"Stacking Tasks**"
msgstr "**立方体堆叠和箱立方体堆叠任务的预期成功率和建议**"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:670
msgid ""
"SkillGen data generation and downstream policy success are sensitive to the "
"task and the quality of dataset annotation, and can show high variance."
msgstr "SkillGen 数据生成和下游策略成功对任务和数据集标注质量很敏感，可能会出现较大差异。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:671
msgid ""
"For cube stacking and bin cube stacking, data generation success is "
"typically 40% to 70% when the dataset is properly annotated per the "
"instructions."
msgstr "对于立方体堆叠和箱立方体堆叠，当按照说明正确标注数据集时，数据生成成功率通常为 40% 到 70%。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:672
msgid ""
"Behavior Cloning (BC) policy success from 1000 generated demonstrations "
"trained for 2000 epochs (default) is typically 40% to 85% for these tasks, "
"depending on data quality."
msgstr ""
"对于这些任务，从 1000 个生成的演示训练 2000 个轮次（默认）的行为克隆（BC）策略成功率通常为 40% 到 85%，具体取决于数据质量。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:673
msgid ""
"Training the policy with 1000 demonstrations and for 2000 epochs takes about"
" 30 to 35 minutes on a RTX 6000 Ada GPU. Training time increases with the "
"number of demonstrations and epochs."
msgstr ""
"使用 1000 个演示训练 2000 个轮次在 RTX 6000 Ada GPU 上大约需要 30 到 35 "
"分钟。训练时间随演示数量和轮次的增加而增加。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:674
msgid ""
"For dataset generation time, see :ref:`task-basic-cube-stacking` and "
":ref:`task-bin-cube-stacking`."
msgstr ""
"有关数据集生成时间，请参阅 :ref:`task-basic-cube-stacking` 和 :ref:`task-bin-cube-"
"stacking` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:675
msgid ""
"Recommendation: Train for the default 2000 epochs with about 1000 generated "
"demonstrations, and evaluate multiple checkpoints saved after the 1000th "
"epoch to select the best-performing policy."
msgstr "建议: 使用约 1000 个生成的演示训练默认的 2000 个轮次，并评估第 1000 轮次之后保存的多个检查点，以选择性能最佳的策略。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:680
msgid "cuRobo Interface Features"
msgstr "cuRobo 接口特性"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:682
msgid ""
"This section summarizes the cuRobo planner interface and features. The "
"SkillGen pipeline uses the cuRobo planner to generate collision-free motions"
" between subtask segments. However, the user can use cuRobo as a standalone "
"motion planner for your own tasks. The user can also implement their own "
"motion planner by subclassing the base motion planner and implementing the "
"same API."
msgstr ""
"本节总结了 cuRobo 规划器接口和特性。SkillGen 流水线使用 cuRobo 规划器为子任务段之间生成无碰撞运动。然而，用户可以将 "
"cuRobo 用作自己任务的独立运动规划器。用户也可以通过继承基本运动规划器和实现相同 API 来实现自己的运动规划器。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:685
msgid "Base Motion Planner (Extensible)"
msgstr "基本运动规划器（可扩展）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:687
msgid "Location: ``isaaclab_mimic/motion_planners/base_motion_planner.py``"
msgstr "位置: ``isaaclab_mimic/motion_planners/base_motion_planner.py``"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:688
msgid "Purpose: Uniform interface for all motion planners used by SkillGen"
msgstr "目的: SkillGen 使用的所有运动规划器的统一接口"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:689
msgid ""
"Extensibility: New planners can be added by subclassing and implementing the"
" same API; SkillGen consumes the API without code changes"
msgstr "可扩展性: 可通过继承和实现相同 API 来添加新的规划器；SkillGen 在不改变代码的情况下消耗 API"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:692
msgid "cuRobo Planner (GPU, collision-aware)"
msgstr "cuRobo 规划器（GPU，具有碰撞感知）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:694
msgid "Location: ``isaaclab_mimic/motion_planners/curobo``"
msgstr "位置: ``isaaclab_mimic/motion_planners/curobo``"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:695
msgid "Multi-phase planning:"
msgstr "多阶段规划: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:697
