#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:744
msgid "Generation Pipeline Integration"
msgstr "生成流水线集成"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:746
msgid ""
"When ``--use_skillgen`` is enabled in ``generate_dataset.py``, the following"
" pipeline is executed:"
msgstr "当 ``--use_skillgen`` 在 ``generate_dataset.py`` 中启用时，将执行以下流程:"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:748
msgid ""
"**Randomize subtask boundaries**: Randomize per-demo start and termination "
"indices for each subtask using task-configured offset ranges."
msgstr "**随机化子任务边界**: 使用任务配置的偏移范围为每个子任务随机化启动和终止索引。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:750
msgid "**Build per-subtask trajectories**: For each end-effector and subtask:"
msgstr "**构建每个子任务的轨迹**: 对于每个末端执行器和子任务:"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:753
msgid ""
"Select a source demonstration segment (strategy-driven; respects "
"coordination/sequential constraints)"
msgstr "选择一个源演示片段（基于策略驱动；遵守协调/顺序约束）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:754
msgid ""
"Transform the segment to the current scene (object-relative or coordination "
"delta; optional first-pose interpolation)"
msgstr "将该片段转换到当前场景（对象相对或协调增量；可选首姿插值）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:755
msgid "Wrap the transformed segment into a waypoint trajectory"
msgstr "将转换后的片段包装成路径点轨迹"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:757
msgid ""
"**Transition between subtasks**: - Plan a collision-aware transition with "
"cuRobo to the subtask's first waypoint (world sync, optional attach/detach),"
" execute the planned waypoints, then resume the subtask trajectory"
msgstr ""
"**在子任务之间过渡**: - 与 cuRobo 计划一次与子任务的第一个路径点（世界同步，可选附加/卸载）的避碰过渡执行计划路径点，然后恢复子任务轨迹"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:760
msgid ""
"**Execute with constraints**: - Execute waypoints step-by-step across end-"
"effectors while enforcing subtask constraints (sequential, coordination with"
" synchronous steps); optionally update planner visualization if enabled"
msgstr "**带约束执行**: 沿着执行轨迹步进执行末端执行器，同时强制执行子任务约束（顺序、协调与同步步骤）; 如果启用，可以选择更新计划可视化"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:763
msgid ""
"**Record and export**: - Accumulate states/observations/actions, set the "
"episode success flag, and export the episode (the outer pipeline "
"filters/consumes successes)"
msgstr "**记录和导出**: - 积累状态/观测/动作，设置剧集成功标志，并导出剧集（外部流程过滤/捕获成功）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:767
msgid "Visualization and Debugging"
msgstr "可视化和调试"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:769
msgid ""
"Users can visualize the planned trajectories and debug for collisions using "
"Rerun-based plan visualizer. This can be enabled by setting ``visualize_plan"
" = True`` in the cuRobo planner configuration. Note that rerun needs to be "
"installed to visualize the planned trajectories. Refer to Step 3 in "
":ref:`skillgen-installation` for installation instructions."
msgstr ""
"用户可以使用基于重运行的计划可视化器可视化计划轨迹并进行碰撞调试。可以通过在 cuRobo 计划器配置中设置 ``visualize_plan = "
"True`` 来启用此功能。请注意，需要安装 rerun 才能可视化计划轨迹。有关安装说明，请参阅 :ref:`skillgen-"
"installation` 中的第 3 步。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:771
msgid "Rerun visualization of planned trajectories and collisions"
msgstr "重运行可视化计划的轨迹和碰撞"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/skillgen.rst:777
msgid "Rerun integration: planned trajectories with collision spheres."
msgstr "重运行集成: 计划轨迹与碰撞球体。"

